Explain the concept of “container components” in React Redux.

Container components are React components that are responsible for interacting with the Redux store. They are connected to the Redux store using the connect() function. Container components acts as the bridge between the Redux store and presentational components, providing them with the necessary data from the store and actions to dispatch.

