What is the purpose of the reselect library in Redux?

The purpose of the Reselect library in Redux is to optimize the performance of selectors. It provides a memoization mechanism that caches the results of selector functions based on their input selectors. This means that if the input selectors and arguments to a selector function remain unchanged between invocations, Reselect will return the cached result instead of recomputing it, leading to significant performance improvements.

